[17592186408164 1072 #uuid "3676ec52-02c6-5b83-a547-e552c5ceb042" 13194139533563 17592186045585 true] [17592186408164 1074 "First, let's represent $D$ as a type I region. \n\n- To determine the $x$-limits, we need to find the $x$-coordinates of the points at which the curves intersect. So, we set the following equation and solve it for $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-{x}^{2} & =-1 \\\\ {x}^{2} & =1 \\\\ x & =\\pm 1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, $x$-limits are \n$-1\\le x\\le 1.$\n\n- To determine the lower and upper functions, we draw a vertical arrow through the region.\n\n![](images/ef/ef6450f795d0edea8a3217e28d7f1a966d5b1c62f9241826213de0485af5f860.png)\n\nAs a result, we get\n\n$$\nD={(x,y)\\,:\\,-1\\le x\\le 1,\\,-1\\le y\\le -{x}^{2}}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we can express the integral as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{D}({x}^{2}y-3x)\\,dA & ={\\int }_{-1}^{1}{\\int }_{-1}^{-{x}^{2}}({x}^{2}y-3x)\\,dy\\,dx\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533563 17592186045585 true] [17592186408165 1068 #edb/ref 17592186408163 13194139533563 17592186045585 true] [17592186408165 1069 "q-132285" 13194139533563 17592186045585 true] [17592186408165 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533563 17592186045585 true] [17592186408165 1071 "${\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{{x}^{2}}^{1}({x}^{2}+2y)\\,dy\\,dx=$" 13194139533563 17592186045585 true] [17592186408165 1072 #uuid "ffe5914e-4912-5ff3-9b15-3a1462960003" 13194139533563 17592186045585 true] [17592186408165 1074 "The integral is defined over a type I region.\n\nFirst, we evaluate the inner integral by integrating with respect to $y$, treating $x$ as a constant:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{1}{\\int }_{{x}^{2}}^{1}({x}^{2}+2y)\\,dy\\,dx & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}[{\\int }_{{x}^{2}}^{1}({x}^{2}+2y)\\,dy]dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}[{x}^{2}y+{y}^{2}]_{{x}^{2}}^{1}\\,dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}({x}^{2}+1-{x}^{4}-{x}^{4})\\,dx \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}({x}^{2}+1-2{x}^{4})\\,dx\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we integrate with respect to $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\int }_{0}^{1}({x}^{2}+1-2{x}^{4})\\,dx & ={[\\frac{1}{3}{x}^{3}+x-\\frac{2}{5}{x}^{5}]}_{0}^{1} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}+1-\\frac{2}{5} \\\\  & =\\frac{14}{15}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533563 17592186045585 true] [17592186408166 1058 #edb/ref 17592186408169 13194139533563 17592186045585 true] [17592186408166 1062 #uuid "098028bf-3706-5127-9bb7-debd78e7b253" 13194139533563 17592186045585 true] [17592186408166 1063 #edb/ref 17592186323935 13194139533563 17592186045585 true] [17592186408167 1062 #uuid "20fb188a-faf6-5a84-b51f-1b3b2dd89239" 13194139533563 17592186045585 true] [17592186408167 1063 #edb/ref 17592186408165 13194139533563 17592186045585 true] [17592186408168 1058 #edb/ref 17592186408167 13194139533563 17592186045585 true] [17592186408168 1062 #uuid "597be508-6945-5d32-9627-435849b9418f" 13194139533563 17592186045585 true] [17592186408168 1063 #edb/ref 17592186351302 13194139533563 17592186045585 true] [17592186408169 1058 #edb/ref 17592186408170 13194139533563 17592186045585 true] [17592186408169 1062 #uuid "780a6e09-0224-5a5e-9ae0-33ed21780a56" 13194139533563 17592186045585 true] [17592186408169 1063 #edb/ref 17592186323959 13194139533563 17592186045585 true] [17592186408170 1058 #edb/ref 17592186408168 13194139533563 17592186045585 true] [17592186408170 1062 #uuid "c5dbc16c-f16e-55e5-b468-49e1c21fdfb0" 13194139533563 17592186045585 true] [17592186408170 1063 #edb/ref 17592186408164 13194139533563 17592186045585 true]] :edb/tempids {"activity-74e0d3a9-0075-5d33-b25c-7e801fde9553" 17592186408151 "answer-100fac5f-cc12-56dc-9567-ee01010ba781" 17592186408152 "answer-1377aca7-a017-58fe-8e23-256c042e11b6" 17592186408153 "answer-3aabdbf2-aad9-5028-8b69-34e437771408" 17592186408154 "answer-41ea5617-4c16-5bdc-a231-c9432f86dc81" 17592186408155 "answer-58f2f8c3-eca9-558a-ae7f-9a78208457ea" 17592186408156 "answer-647e13d7-fe24-5171-9f25-59459873bf42" 17592186408157 "answer-93175eb3-2514-5cc0-a423-e088c96ac28d" 17592186408158 "answer-93b1f2e7-cf7b-5b8a-b5bb-c62e